    "tactics": "Gang members use Swift Movement to dart between cover and allies. They trigger Exploit Weakness through numbers or by attacking a target already under pressure, then disengage before the target can retaliate. They surrender or flee when their leader falls.",
    "attacksNotes": "<p>Dagger [Combat]: Melee attack (Agil 7 + Melee Combat 3), Reach: 5 ft</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Margin 1:</strong>: 8 damage (4 + 4 Str)</li>\n<li><strong>Margin 2:</strong> 8 damage, DR halved (round up)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Thrown Dagger [Combat]: Ranged attack (Dex 6 + Ranged Combat 2), Range: 30/60 ft</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Margin 1:</strong>: 10 damage (4 + 6 Dex)</li>\n<li><strong>Margin 2:</strong> 10 damage, DR halved (round up)</li>\n</ul>",
